   "title": "2027: Akpabio predicts highest South-South votes for Tinubu from Akwa Ibom",
   "url": "https://www.vanguardngr.com/2026/11/2027-akpabio-predicts-highest-south-south-votes-for-tinubu-from-akwa-ibom/",
   "domain": "vanguardngr.com",
