   "title": "Anambra coalition is battle for Nigeria’s soul",
   "url": "https://www.vanguardngr.com/2026/11/anambra-coalition-is-battle-for-nigerias-soul-soludo/",
   "domain": "vanguardngr.com",
   "source": "vanguardngr.com",
