   "summary": "Unlock these with Subscription Delhi witnessed two parallel political protests on November 1, with the INDIA bloc holding a rally at Ramlila Maidan against Chief Election Commissioner Gyanesh Kumar over alleged electoral irregularities and vote theft. Meanwhile, the BJP held a march from Hari Nagar to Tilak Nagar, demanding a Congress apology for the 1984 anti-Sikh riots. Union Home Minister Amit Shah and BJP MP Sambit Patra also criticised Rahul Gandhi and the INDIA bloc rally, questioning its timing and turnout.",
   "summary_zh": "订阅即可解锁这些内容。11月1日，德里发生了两场并行政治抗议。INDIA联盟在Ramlile Maidan举行集会，针对首席选举专员贾内什·库马尔，指控存在选举违规和窃取选票。与此同时，BJP举行从Hari Nagar到Tilak Nagar的游行，要求国大党为1984年反锡克骚乱道歉。联邦内政部长阿米特·沙阿和BJP议员桑比特·帕特拉也批评拉胡尔·甘地及INDIA联盟的集会，质疑其举行时机和参与人数。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Account subscription benefits alongside Premium Stories, Editorials, Opinions and more. Unlock these with Subscription Delhi witnessed two parallel political protests on November 1, with the INDIA bloc holding a rally at Ramlila Maidan against Chief Election Commissioner Gyanesh Kumar over alleged electoral irregularities and vote theft. Rahul Gandhi, Mallikarjun Kharge and Mamata Banerjee called for action against the CEC and demanded an end to the Special Intensive Revision of electoral rolls. Meanwhile, the BJP held a march from Hari Nagar to Tilak Nagar, demanding a Congress apology for the 1984 anti-Sikh riots. Union Home Minister Amit Shah and BJP MP Sambit Patra also criticised Rahul Gandhi and the INDIA bloc rally, questioning its timing and turnout. Comments have to be in English, and in full sentences. They cannot be abusive or personal. Please abide by our community guidelines for posting your comments. We have migrated to a new commenting platform. If you are already a registered user of The Hindu and logged in, you may continue to engage with our articles. If you do not have an account please register and login to post comments. Users can access their older comments by logging into their accounts on Vuukle",
