   "summary": "4 -MIN READ 4 -MIN 1 Listen Sherry Wang in Beijing Published: 4:00pm, 1 Nov 2026 While trade tensions between Beijing and Brussels remain elevated, some European businesses are pointing to disruptions from the United States as a bigger challenge. Instead, they are seeking closer cooperation with China, even as Chinese carmakers scramble to front-load exports ahead of potential future trade barriers.",
   "summary_zh": "4分钟阅读 4分钟 1 收听 北京的谢里·王 发布于2026年11月1日下午4:00 尽管北京与布鲁塞尔的贸易紧张局势持续高企，一些欧洲企业却认为，来自美国的干扰构成更大的挑战。因此，他们正寻求与中国加强合作，尽管中国汽车制造商正抢先出口，以赶在潜在的未来贸易壁垒出现之前扩大出口。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "4 -MIN READ 4 -MIN 1 Listen Sherry Wang in Beijing Published: 4:00pm, 1 Nov 2026 While trade tensions between Beijing and Brussels remain elevated, some European businesses are pointing to disruptions from the United States as a bigger challenge. Instead, they are seeking closer cooperation with China, even as Chinese carmakers scramble to front-load exports ahead of potential future trade barriers. At last week’s 19th Europe-China Business and Technology Cooperation Fair in the southwestern Chinese city of Chengdu, the appetite for closer business ties was evident",
