   "summary": "The Incorporated Trustees of NNPC/MPN JV EMOIMEE Host Community Development Trust (HCDT) have awarded scholarships and bursaries to 4,510 students in secondary and tertiary institutions across its seven constituent local government areas. The beneficiaries, drawn from Eastern Obolo, Mkpat Enin, Onna, Ikot Abasi, Mbo, Eket and Esit Eket Local Government Areas of Akwa Ibom State, Read More: https://punchng.com/4510-akwa-ibom-students-get-scholarships-bursaries/",
   "summary_zh": "尼日利亚国家石油公司与MPN合资企业埃莫米伊东道社区发展信托基金的受托机构已向其7个组成地方政府区域的中学和高校学生授予奖学金和助学金，共惠及4,510名学生。受惠者来自阿夸伊博姆州东部奥博洛、姆克帕特埃宁、奥纳、伊科特阿巴西、姆博、埃凯特和埃西特埃凯特地方政府区域。阅读更多：https://punchng.com/4510-akwa-ibom-students-get-scholarships-bursaries/",
