   "summary": "By Chidi Nkwopara OWERRI — The Anglican Archbishop of Owerri, Most Rev. Onuoha, has expressed concern over Nigeria’s rising debt profile, questioning the Federal Government’s continued resort to borrowing amid the country’s economic challenges. Onuoha raised the concern on Thursday while flagging off the Provincial Council meeting at St. Paul’s Anglican Church, […] The post appeared first on Vanguard News",
   "summary_zh": "齐迪·恩克沃帕拉 奥韦里——奥韦里圣公会大主教、尊敬的奥努奥哈主教express了对尼日利亚债务规模不断上升的担忧，质疑在该国面临经济挑战之际，联邦政府仍持续依赖借债。奥努奥哈周四在圣保罗圣公会教堂为省议会会议揭幕时提出了这一关切，…… 该帖首先发布于 Vanguard News",
   "summarySource": "index",
   "body": "By Chidi Nkwopara OWERRI — The Anglican Archbishop of Owerri, Most Rev. David O. C. Onuoha, has expressed concern over Nigeria’s rising debt profile, questioning the Federal Government’s continued resort to borrowing amid the country’s economic challenges. Onuoha raised the concern on Thursday while flagging off the Provincial Council meeting at St. Paul’s Anglican Church, […] The post appeared first on Vanguard News",
