   "snippet": "🔴 Russia's Indonesia oil stake offers no shield against China claims\n\nRussian state oil company Zarubezhneft holds 50% of the Tuna gas block in Indonesia's exclusive economic zone off the Natuna Islands—waters China claims under its nine-dash line. In 2021, when a rig arrived to drill, a Chinese coast guard vessel appeared within days and demanded Indonesia halt work in what Beijing called Chinese territory. Indonesia refused and completed exploration.\nZarubezhneft's ownership provided no protection then and offers none now.",
