   "url": "https://x.com/JanTMorgan/status/2115919831908147513",
   "snippet": "We apply the model to Russian crude, calibrating it to pre-sanctions data and treating India and China as the bystander. Cooperation between Russia and the bystander best matches the trade flows and oil discount that we measure in the aftermath of sanctions. Through the lens of our model, their behavior is more consistent with sharing the gains from cooperation than with independently extracting as much surplus from Russia as possible. [10/12]",
